[{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21500900_02_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21500900_02_0010","text":"……所以\n点心虽然很好吃……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21500900_02_0020","text":"……但比平时，\n有点，不好吃……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21500900_02_0030","text":"——嗯"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21500900_02_0040","text":"甜花……\n也给小奈和千雪小姐……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21500900_02_0050","text":"添了麻烦……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21500900_02_0051","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21500900_02_0060","text":"…………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21500900_02_0070","text":"甜花，甘奈和千雪肯定都不会觉得是麻烦的"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21500900_02_0080","text":"……是这样吗……？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21500900_02_0090","text":"是啊。她们俩是想让甜花打起精神来，才给你点心的吧？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21500900_02_0100","text":"……嘿嘿……\n如果是那样，就好了……"}]
